<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Terms — <%= settings.title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="<%= settings.favicon_path %>" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=<%= assetV %>">
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/announcement') %>
<%- include('partials/nav', { active: '' }) %>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#000 0%,#001a3a 60%,#000 100%);padding:4rem 2rem 3rem;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,rgba(0,112,209,0.12) 0%,transparent 65%);pointer-events:none;"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
    <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;background:rgba(0,112,209,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(0,112,209,0.3);border-radius:20px;padding:0.35rem 1rem;font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--ps-blue);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Plain language</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:1rem;">Terms</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1rem;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;">How a PlayStation Hub rental works, in everyday words. The step-by-step is on <a href="/how-it-works" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">How It Works</a>. Questions are on the <a href="/faq" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">FAQ</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 2rem 4rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Rentals</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">A rental is Weekly (7 days) or Monthly (30 days). Monthly is 10% off. You pick the game, the account type, and the length on the site.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Account types</h2>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">Non-Trophy</strong> is the cheapest. Play happens on the shop account. There is no deposit.</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 0.6rem;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">Trophy</strong> is your own profile. Trophies and saves stay with you. The price is higher than Non-Trophy, and there is a ₱100 refundable deposit.</p>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><strong style="color:#fff;">PS4 Primary</strong> is Trophy-style (your own profile, trophies and saves, ₱100 refundable deposit). It is only for games that support PS4.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Payment</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;"><%- include('partials/pay-note').trim() %>. Local payment is a GCash or Maya QR, mostly via Messenger. International customers pay via PayPal.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Access</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Access is through a console sign-in QR code. Customers never share a password. See <a href="/how-to-sign-in" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">How to Sign In</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Deposit</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">The ₱100 deposit on Trophy and PS4 Primary is refunded when the account is returned with proof.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Bought games</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Bought games are permanent. There is no return and no end date.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Sold out</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Sold-out games have a free waitlist. You join from the game page.</p>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#0d0d0d;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 0.45rem;">Contact</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#aaa;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.65;">Email <a href="mailto:playstationhub00@gmail.com" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">playstationhub00@gmail.com</a>, <a href="http://m.me/PlaystationHub00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Messenger</a>, or <a href="https://facebook.com/PlaystationHub00" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--ps-blue);">Facebook</a>.</p>
  </section>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
